=== Unsuccessful Procedure ===

  - Flashing via ubnt GUI: failed to accept any FW lower than XW.v6.1.3. "Firmware image check failed. Error code: 43"
  - Flashing via SSH: using ubnt fwupdate.real command failed to accept any FW lower than XW.v6.1.3
  - Flashing via TFTP: did accept FW lower than XW.v6.1.3 but with "Initialization Error A12".

=== Successful Procedure ===

I installed the "cs" custom scripts versions of AirOS in this order

  - via AirOS GUI or SSH: Downgrade from XWv6.1.7 to XWv6.1.4
  - using TFTP downgrade to XW.v6.1.3  
  - then OpenWrt 19.07.x factory (this process must be done via TFTP).

[[https://community.ui.com/questions/airOS-5-6-with-Custom-Script-Support-/4bd71c6b-7e9c-43ee-9d9d-666a7a9708fd]]

[[https://forum.openwrt.org/t/installation-of-openwrt-on-litebeam-m5/46607]]

